<% content_for :title, "排行榜 - 星港货柜调度竞速" %>

<div class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
    🏆 排行榜
  </h2>
  <p class="text-slate-400">查看各关卡的顶尖玩家</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
  <% @by_level.each do |level, scores| %>
    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-purple-500/20 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="p-4 bg-slate-700/50 border-b border-slate-600/50">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-2xl"><%= difficulty_emoji(level.difficulty) %></span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-lg"><%= level.name %></h3>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
                目标: <%= number_with_delimiter(level.target_score) %>分 · 
                <span class="<%= difficulty_class(level.difficulty) %> px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full"><%= difficulty_label(level.difficulty) %></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">你的排名</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-cyan-400">
              <%= @player_rankings[level.id] %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <% if scores.any? %>
        <table class="w-full">
          <thead class="bg-slate-700/30">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider w-12">#</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">玩家</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2 text-right text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">得分</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-700/50">
            <% scores.each_with_index do |session, index| %>
              <tr class="hover:bg-slate-700/30 transition">
                <td class="px-4 py-3">
                  <span class="<%= index < 3 ? 'font-bold' : '' %>">
                    <%= index == 0 ? '🥇' : index == 1 ? '🥈' : index == 2 ? '🥉' : index + 1 %>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3">
                  <span class="<%= session.player_id == session[:player_id].to_i ? 'text-cyan-400 font-bold' : '' %>">
                    <%= session.player.name %>
                    <% if session.player_id == session[:player_id].to_i %>
                      <span class="text-xs text-cyan-400">(你)</span>
                    <% end %>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-4 py-3 text-right font-mono font-bold text-yellow-400">
                  <%= number_with_delimiter(session.score) %>
                </td>
              </tr>
            <% end %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <% else %>
        <div class="p-8 text-center text-slate-400">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-2">🎯</div>
          <p>暂无记录，成为第一个上榜的玩家！</p>
          <%= link_to "开始挑战", level_game_sessions_path(level), method: :post,
            class: "mt-4 inline-block px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-purple-500 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-purple-400 font-medium transition text-sm" %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>

<div class="mt-12 bg-slate-800/40 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-8 border border-purple-500/20">
  <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">🏅 排名规则</h3>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-slate-300 text-sm">
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-2">分数优先</h4>
      <p>排行榜按最终得分从高到低排序，得分相同的情况下用时较短者排名靠前。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-semibold text-purple-400 mb-2">关卡独立</h4>
      <p>每个关卡有独立的排行榜，不同难度的关卡分开计算排名。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="font-semibold text-pink-400 mb-2">后端验证</h4>
      <p>所有分数都经过后端重新计算验证，确保排行榜的公平性和准确性。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
